    "en": {
      "trackName": "Cat Road",
      "description": "Cat Road is a retro-style pixel runner game for Apple Watch.\n\nTilt the Digital Crown or swipe to guide your cat past cacti, rocks, and school buses. The longer you survive, the faster obstacles come.\n\nFeatures:\n\nPixel art cat with walk animation\n4 obstacle types with progressive difficulty\nDigital Crown and swipe controls\nHigh score tracking\nChaos Mode easter egg — triple-tap the score to activate\nHaptic feedback\nSupports 7 languages",
      "releaseNotes": "• Fixed bus wheel visibility issue that caused incorrect collision detection\n  • Fixed guide text being cut off on 40mm Apple Watch screens\n  • Cat movement range now adapts to your Apple Watch screen size\n  • Obstacles spawn across the full movement area for a fairer challenge\n  • Friendlier and more encouraging in-game messages",
      "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/us/app/cat-road/id6759817728?uo=4",
